rs with more Supernatural and  Magic based characters to stop a demonic  threat Marvel's midnight Suns will drop  for PlayStation 5 Xbox series xns and PC  on December 2nd  Need for Speed has a number of games  about street racing but Need for Speed  Unbound just might be one of the most  distinct entries in the long-running  series thanks to its cel-shaded visuals  that make it look like a high-speed  anime series in the story players will  attempt to win the grand the ultimate  street racing challenge in Lakeshore  collecting cars and using them as a  canvas to show off their personal style  on the streets EA has confirmed that  they'll be 143 cards to collect and  customize with the list of available  Vehicles being a mix of iconic racing  machines and modern Monsters the game  has more than 10 000 customization  options to choose from that includes  more than just installing new parts and  whether you're just adding new  graffiti-like effects or taking first  place you're gonna want something dope  to listen to Unbound will have more than  70 tracks with the playlist including  ASAP Rocky Kelvin crash slow tie and  more in a collection inspired by global  hip-hop artists Need for Speed Unbound  will be racing onto PlayStation 5 Xbox  series X and S and PC on December 2nd  hello neighbor 2 is a stealth Adventure  game that also falls into the family  friendly horror genre it's the sequel to  2017's hello neighbor but it's the third  game in the series if you count the 2019  multiplayer game secret neighbor unlike  the first game which had you  investigating your neighbor's basement  for Secrets the entire town of  ravenbrooks is hiding secrets from you  this time around as Quentin your job is  to sneak around town and get to the  bottom of the series of missing persons  reports coming from this suspiciously  peaceful town but don't expect to find  those Secrets easily hello neighbor 2  features sophisticated AI controlled  neighbors that will learn from you and  do everything they can to keep you away  from the skeletons in their closet hello  neighbor 2 is sneaking onto PC and every  console except for switch on December  6th it'll also be available Day One on  Game Pass  chained Echoes is a 16-bit style jrpg  set in the fantasy world of Atlantis a  vast continent with Three Kingdoms At  War in the game you play as a group of  Heroes that aim to bring an end to that  war to do this you'll travel across  various locations battling enemies using  a sword magic or even a mech suit  chained Echoes features fast-paced  turn-based combat tons of items to loot  a complex skill system a customizable  Airship and music inspired by classic  PlayStation RPGs of the past find out if  you can bring peace to this nation when  chained Echoes Launches on PC in every  console on December 8th  choo choo Charles is an open world  Adventure horror game in which your goal  is to destroy a bloodthirsty spider  train named Charles let me say that  again so it really sinks in a  bloodthirsty spider train named Charles  reminds me of how Thomas the Tank Engine  has made an appearance as the enemy in a  number of games thanks to mods in the  game you'll navigate your own train  through a Tetris Play area to loot carry  out missions and help settlers in order  to upgrade your train and obtain  high-powered weapons and when you're  ready you can take on Charles and  finally put an end to his Terror you can  develop a fear of trains when choo choo  Charles comes to PC on December 9th  in Dragon Quest Treasures you play as  Eric and his sister Mia after being  transported to the land of free roaming  monsters called draconia luckily not all  of these monsters are out to get you and  some can be befriended in order to  better Traverse the map and score  Treasures from hard to reach places it's  up to you to put together the best  treasure hunting game possible and to  help you do that there's a base where  you can swap party members or send  groups out on their own for a chance at  scoring rare loot draconia is also home  to the seven Dragon stones and you'll  have to beat rival gangs to each one if  you're keen on having the whole  collection what will you find when  Dragon Quest Treasures releases on  switch December 9th  Crisis Core Final Fantasy VII reunion is  a faithful retelling of the 2007 PSP  title Crisis Core Final Fantasy VII at  the center of the game is Zach Fair a  young Shinra soldier who both original  Final Fantasy fans and Final Fantasy VII  remake fans alike will recognize as a  close colleague of Cloud Strife the game  follows his mission to locate a missing  Soldier by the name of Genesis Rhapsody  though as you can imagine things don't  go quite as smoothly as Zach might have  hoped the game acts as a prequel to  Final Fantasy VII with Zack's story  being a significant chapter in the lives  of cloud Tifa aerith and sephiroth  players can look forward to improved HD  graphics refreshed character models  fully voice acted dialogue and a new  arrangement for the soundtrack it will  also serve as our first HD look at some  key locations that will surely be in the  next chapters of the Final Fantasy  remake Trilogy you can relive your PSP  days when Crisis Core Final Fantasy 7  reunion drops on PC in every console on  December 13th  high on life is a first person shooter  from the mind of Rick and Morty and  solar opposites co-creator Justin  Roiland and squanch games in the main  campaign you play as an unemployed high  school graduate who teams up with a  group of talking guns to save the cosmos  from an alien cartel looking to  literally get high off Humanity to do  this you'll travel to a variety of  locations such as a jungle paradise and  a City built inside of an asteroid  you'll meet interesting weird and  hilarious characters collect Loot and an  array of alien technology and kick a ton  of Intergalactic ass my own life is  coming to PC Xbox One and Xbox series  xns on December 13th and will be  playable on Xbox game pass at launch we  also have 30 minutes of gameplay up on  the channel right now so check it out  The Witcher 3 wild Hunt is one of my  favorite games of all time in this  December the game is getting a facelift  for next-gen consoles and PC The Witcher  3 will now include Ray tracing and  ambient occlusion on PC PlayStation 5  and Xbox series X a photo mode and new  camera modes that bring it closer to  Garrow there are a variety of other  quality of life improvements coming with  the update including new walking and  jogging options for Geral and the  ability to change the size of the game's  subtitles the new update arrives on  December 14th alongside the complete  edition which includes the base game all  DLC and the two major expansions hearts  of stone and blood and wine at launch  the complete edition will be digital  only but the physical version is coming  later for those who already own The  Witcher 3 wild Hunt on PlayStation 4  Xbox One and PC they can get the next  gen upgrades for free let us know in the  comments which game you're most excited  to play in December and look out for the  biggest games of January video later in  the month  foreign
 

